Sokoban is actually fairly early in the dungeon, especially for a
player who choose not to enter the Mines.  Altars are not generated in
Sokoban.  Carrying even a single giant out of the tower to an altar is
beyond many characters' means without going at least into Stressed,
and probably into Overloaded, which are very dangerous states even if
Sokoban's orientation means getting them down the stairs is possible.
The player may not have found a like-aligned altar, or even any altar
at all.  Breaking boulders causing negative luck is a serious
condition; prayer never works if your luck is less than zero.  It is
true that, long term, it isn't a problem, but neither is nearly
everything else in Nethack, provided you can survive the early game.

